{"type":"message","id":"02e085e7","parentId":"177fcb27","timestamp":"2026-04-07T08:52:10.861Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b527815901ca0eea671ebecb20ef\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b520dcdc5a4a0ee8a5a7a2a2f164\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"sender\": \"听风\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-07 08:52 UTC\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"听风 (ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\",\n  \"name\": \"听风\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"ECHO是一个能管理所有权、使用权、衍生权、扩展权（跨平台或场景使用）四权分离的区块链资产协议，并能实现资产交互过程中的自动分润。现在想将其与 OpenClaw 的 AI Agent 生态有机结合，将\\\"权\\\"转化为 Agent 能力，既能让agent接入echo资产协议，又能让其他人通过agent使用echo协议，将细分领域高价值技能/知识库的付费/受控使用生态等，设计基于openClaw而优化的AI智能体、链上系统以及其他配套，以促进各细分领域高价值知识、经验在AI(Agents)原生工作方式下的流通。\\n\\necho协议已经完成，现在要做的就是将其与agent融合。\\nECHO 是一个 NFT  Rental + Licensing + 衍生分润 的区块链协议\\n核心模块（9个接口）：\\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\\n资产层\\n├── 1.1 资产创建和租用\\n│   mint() → 原创资产\\n│   createDerivative() → 衍生资产（需付 upfrontFee）\\n│   rentEcho() → 租赁使用权\\n│   selfDerive() → 自衍生（一次mint父+子+建立关系）\\n│\\n├── 1.2 费用与状态设置\\n│   updateRentalInfo() → 定价（TimesBased/DurationBased）\\n│   setExtensible() → 授权拓展 + 分润比例上限\\n│   setDerivTerms() → 衍生条款（upfrontFee + usageRoyalty）\\n│\\n使用权层（IECHO）\\n├── 1.3 使用权管理\\n│   useECHO() → 触发分润\\n│   userOf() / getRemainingTimes / getUseStatus → 状态查询\\n│\\n租赁分润层（IECHORentable）\\n├── 1.4 可租赁 + 分润\\n│   EchoRented → 租赁事件\\n│   RevenueDistributedBase → 使用分润给资产owner\\n│\\n授权管理层\\n├── 1.5 拓展权授权（OwnerDirect 模式）\\n│   approvePermission() / revokePermission()\\n│\\n├── 1.6 拓展权申请（RequestBased 模式）\\n│   requestPermission() → 消费合约主动申请\\n│   approvePermissionRequest() / rejectPermissionRequest()\\n│   updateSceneBeneficiary() → 更新场景受益人\\n│\\n├── 1.7 拓展使用和分润\\n│   useECHOOf() → 场景内使用\\n│   RevenueDistributedForScene → 场景分润\\n│\\n衍生层（IECHODerivable）\\n├── 1.8 衍生权管理\\n│   requestAsDerivative() → 发起衍生请求\\n│   approveDerivativeRequest() / rejectDerivativeRequest()\\n│   getDerivativeGraph() → 衍生图谱查询\\n│   getParentShareList() → 亲代分润表\\n│\\n├── 1.9 衍生分润\\n│   DerivFeePaid → 一次性衍生费\\n│   DerivRevenueDistributed → 衍生品使用时向父代分润\\n\\n结合ECHO合约接口的架构，以及这个设计方案 echonexus-website.html，能否做一个react app出来\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b527815901ca0eea671ebecb20ef]\n听风: [Replying to: \"ECHO是一个能管理所有权、使用权、衍生权、扩展权（跨平台或场景使用）四权分离的区块链资产协议，并能实现资产交互过程中的自动分润。现在想将其与 OpenClaw 的 AI Agent 生态有机结合，将\"权\"转化为 Agent 能力，既能让agent接入echo资产协议，又能让其他人通过agent使用echo协议，将细分领域高价值技能/知识库的付费/受控使用生态等，设计基于openClaw而优化的AI智能体、链上系统以及其他配套，以促进各细分领域高价值知识、经验在AI(Agents)原生工作方式下的流通。\n\necho协议已经完成，现在要做的就是将其与agent融合。\nECHO 是一个 NFT  Rental + Licensing + 衍生分润 的区块链协议\n核心模块（9个接口）：\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n资产层\n├── 1.1 资产创建和租用\n│   mint() → 原创资产\n│   createDerivative() → 衍生资产（需付 upfrontFee）\n│   rentEcho() → 租赁使用权\n│   selfDerive() → 自衍生（一次mint父+子+建立关系）\n│\n├── 1.2 费用与状态设置\n│   updateRentalInfo() → 定价（TimesBased/DurationBased）\n│   setExtensible() → 授权拓展 + 分润比例上限\n│   setDerivTerms() → 衍生条款（upfrontFee + usageRoyalty）\n│\n使用权层（IECHO）\n├── 1.3 使用权管理\n│   useECHO() → 触发分润\n│   userOf() / getRemainingTimes / getUseStatus → 状态查询\n│\n租赁分润层（IECHORentable）\n├── 1.4 可租赁 + 分润\n│   EchoRented → 租赁事件\n│   RevenueDistributedBase → 使用分润给资产owner\n│\n授权管理层\n├── 1.5 拓展权授权（OwnerDirect 模式）\n│   approvePermission() / revokePermission()\n│\n├── 1.6 拓展权申请（RequestBased 模式）\n│   requestPermission() → 消费合约主动申请\n│   approvePermissionRequest() / rejectPermissionRequest()\n│   updateSceneBeneficiary() → 更新场景受益人\n│\n├── 1.7 拓展使用和分润\n│   useECHOOf() → 场景内使用\n│   RevenueDistributedForScene → 场景分润\n│\n衍生层（IECHODerivable）\n├── 1.8 衍生权管理\n│   requestAsDerivative() → 发起衍生请求\n│   approveDerivativeRequest() / rejectDerivativeRequest()\n│   getDerivativeGraph() → 衍生图谱查询\n│   getParentShareList() → 亲代分润表\n│\n├── 1.9 衍生分润\n│   DerivFeePaid → 一次性衍生费\n│   DerivRevenueDistributed → 衍生品使用时向父代分润\n\n结合ECHO合约接口的架构，以及这个设计方案 echonexus-website.html，能否做一个react app出来\"]\n\n针对这个echonexus项目设计，你是否有更好的设计，你可以结合之前的内容，做一个项目设计"}],"timestamp":1775551930853}}
{"type":"message","id":"74c2004b","parentId":"02e085e7","timestamp":"2026-04-07T08:52:13.207Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_587e22ii5j4aw4kmg7jxmmjg","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echonexus-website.html"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775551930860,"responseId":"02177555193108795d8a1116d5da876fc2f0d05f01fe0be4e4176"}}
{"type":"message","id":"899c1753","parentId":"74c2004b","timestamp":"2026-04-07T08:52:13.235Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_587e22ii5j4aw4kmg7jxmmjg","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>EchoNexus - AI Agent 能力资产化协议</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/font-awesome@4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        primary: '#4f46e5',\n                        secondary: '#7c3aed',\n                        dark: '#1e1b4b',\n                        light: '#f5f3ff',\n                    },\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style type=\"text/tailwindcss\">\n        @layer utilities {\n            .text-gradient {\n                background-clip: text;\n                -webkit-background-clip: text;\n                -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n            }\n            .code-block {\n                background-color: #1e1b4b;\n                color: #e0e7ff;\n                border-radius: 0.5rem;\n                padding: 1rem;\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                line-height: 1.6;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm border-b border-gray-200\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl\">E</div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary text-gradient\">EchoNexus</h1>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">概述</a>\n                <a href=\"#architecture\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">架构</a>\n                <a href=\"#features\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">核心功能</a>\n                <a href=\"#usecases\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">用例</a>\n                <a href=\"#economic\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">经济模型</a>\n                <a href=\"#roadmap\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-primary transition-colors\">路线图</a>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                <a href=\"https://pubial7bv6tj.space.minimaxi.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden md:block px-4 py-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white rounded-lg transition-colors\">\n                    在线 Demo\n                </a>\n                <button id=\"menu-toggle\" class=\"md:hidden text-gray-600\">\n                    <i class=\"fa fa-bars text-xl\"></i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Mobile Menu -->\n        <div id=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"hidden md:hidden bg-white border-t border-gray-200\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">概述</a>\n                <a href=\"#architecture\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">架构</a>\n                <a href=\"#features\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">核心功能</a>\n                <a href=\"#usecases\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">用例</a>\n                <a href=\"#economic\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">经济模型</a>\n                <a href=\"#roadmap\" class=\"py-2 text-gray-600 hover:text-primary\">路线图</a>\n                <a href=\"https://pubial7bv6tj.space.minimaxi.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"py-2 text-primary font-medium\">在线 Demo</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 py-16 md:py-24\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary text-gradient mb-6\">\n                EchoNexus\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                AI Agent 能力资产化协议\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-500 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n                将 AI Agent 的 Skills/Knowledge 转化为可交易的链上资产，实现<br>\"能力即资产，调用即分润\"的原生 AI 经济体系。\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg shadow-primary/20\">\n                    了解更多\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"https://pubial7bv6tj.space.minimaxi.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary rounded-lg font-medium transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-md\">\n                    体验 Demo <i class=\"fa fa-external-link ml-1\"></i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-gray-200 shadow-sm\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-green-600\">\n                    <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle\"></i> v2.0 实现版\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-300\"></span>\n                <span class=\"text-gray-500\">更新日期: 2026-04-03</span>\n                <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-300\"></span>\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-600\">\n                    <i class=\"fa fa-code\"></i> React Demo 已部署\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Overview Section -->\n    <section id=\"overview\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">核心定位</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    <strong class=\"text-primary\">EchoNexus = ECHO 协议 × OpenClaw 执行引擎</strong>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"bg-light rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-indigo-100\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o text-primary\"></i> 愿景\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        打破传统 AI Agent 能力静态绑定的限制，构建一个开放、透明、可交易的 AI 能力市场。创作者可以将自己的技能和知识资产化，用户可以按需付费调用，整个过程通过智能合约自动完成，无需第三方中介。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-light rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-indigo-100\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-exchange text-primary\"></i> 模式对比\n                    </h3>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-200\">\n                                    <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3 font-medium text-gray-600\">维度</th>\n                                    <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3 font-medium text-gray-600\">传统模式</th>\n                                    <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3 font-medium text-primary\">EchoNexus 模式</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody>\n                                <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100\">\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 font-medium\">Agent 能力</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">静态绑定</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-primary\">动态资产化</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100\">\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 font-medium\">使用授权</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">手动审批</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-primary\">智能合约自动</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"border-b border-gray-100\">\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 font-medium\">分润结算</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">中心化清分</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-primary\">链上自动分润</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 font-medium\">能力发现</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">目录检索</td>\n                                    <td class=\"py-2 px-3 text-primary\">资产市场交易</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center\">四权映射</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre>ECHO 协议四权          EchoNexus Agent 能力\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n所有权 (Ownership)     → Agent/Skill 创作者的完整控制权\n使用权 (Usage)         → 按次/按时长付费调用 Agent 能力\n衍生权 (Derivative)    → 基于已有 Skill 构建组合 Skill\n扩展权 (Extension)     → 跨平台/场景授权使用能力</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Architecture Section -->\n    <section id=\"architecture\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">架构设计</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    三层架构设计：Hub 调度层 + 合约层 + 执行层\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n                <div class=\"code-block text-xs md:text-sm\">\n<pre>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         EchoNexus 生态                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                 │\n│  ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐     │\n│  │   能力创建者   │    │   能力运营者   │    │   能力消费者   │     │\n│  │ Creator      │    │   Operator   │    │   Consumer   │     │\n│  └──────┬───────┘    └──────┬───────┘    └──────┬───────┘     │\n│         │                   │                   │              │\n│         ▼                   ▼                   ▼              │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │                    EchoNexus Hub                        │   │\n│  │  ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐  │   │\n│  │  │  能力路由    │ │  权限裁决    │ │   计费结算       │  │   │\n│  │  │  Router     │ │  Arbiter    │ │   Settlement    │  │   │\n│  │  └─────────────┘ └─────────────┘ └─────────────────┘  │   │\n│  │  ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────┐ ┌─────────────────┐  │   │\n│  │  │  能力注册    │ │  使用追踪    │ │   分润引擎      │  │   │\n│  │  │  Registry   │ │  Tracker    │ │   Distributor   │  │   │\n│  │  └─────────────┘ └─────────────┘ └─────────────────┘  │   │\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                              │                                 │\n│         ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐            │\n│         ▼                    ▼                    ▼            │\n│  ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐     │\n│  │   ECHO       │    │  OpenClaw    │    │   外部       │     │\n│  │   合约层     │    │   执行层      │    │   市场       │     │\n│  └──────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └──────────────┘     │\n│                                                                 │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-road text-xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">能力路由</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\n                        智能匹配用户请求和最合适的 Agent 能力，支持多维度评分和优先级排序。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-gavel text-xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">权限裁决</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\n                        基于四权模型的自动化权限校验，支持条件审批和多级授权机制。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-credit-card text-xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">计费结算</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\n                        实时计费，链上自动分润，支持多种定价模型和分润规则。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-book text-xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">能力注册</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">\n                        标准化的能力注册流程，支持元数据管理和版本控制。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Features Section -->\n    <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">核心功能</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    完整的能力资产化全流程支持\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary\">ECHO 合约层</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>资产创建与管理：mint/rent/derivative 全生命周期</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>四权分离模型：所有权/使用权/衍生权/扩展权</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>自动分润机制：按比例实时分配收益</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>权限管理：授权/吊销/申请流程自动化</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary\">执行引擎层</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>智能路由：NLP 解析 + 相似度匹配</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>执行调度：支持并行/串行/条件执行</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>状态追踪：完整的执行日志和审计记录</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>错误处理：自动重试和降级机制</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary\">平台功能</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>资产市场：搜索、筛选、排名、推荐</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>开发者工具：SDK/CLI/低代码编辑器</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>数据分析：使用统计、收益报表、用户画像</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n                            <i class=\"fa fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1\"></i>\n                            <span>治理机制：社区投票和参数调整</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center\">裁决决策树</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre>                    ┌─────────────────┐\n                    │  权限裁决请求    │\n                    └────────┬────────┘\n                             │\n                    ┌────────▼────────┐\n                    │   所有权检查     │\n                    └────────┬────────┘\n                             │\n              ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐\n              │                              │\n     ┌────────▼────────┐            ┌─────────▼────────┐\n     │  用户=所有者?   │            │    继续检查       │\n     └────────┬────────┘            └─────────┬────────┘\n              │                              │\n       ┌──────▼──────┐               ┌───────▼───────┐\n       │ APPROVED ✓  │               │  使用权检查    │\n       └─────────────┘               └───────┬───────┘\n                                             │\n                              ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐\n                              │                              │\n                     ┌─────────▼─────────┐        ┌─────────▼─────────┐\n                     │   已租赁?          │        │   扩展权可用?     │\n                     └─────────┬─────────┘        └─────────┬─────────┘\n                               │                              │\n                    ┌──────────▼──────────┐         ┌─────────▼─────────┐\n                    │ APPROVED (租赁) ✓  │         │  授权的地址?      │\n                    └────────────────────┘         └─────────┬─────────┘\n                                                              │\n                                                     ┌─────────▼─────────┐\n                                                     │ CONDITIONAL (付费)│\n                                                     └───────────────────┘</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Use Cases Section -->\n    <section id=\"usecases\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">用例场景</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    覆盖个人、企业、平台等多场景应用\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <div class=\"h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-balance-scale text-5xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">专业领域顾问 Agent</h3>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 text-sm\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">创作者 A (律师)</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>将法律咨询能力打包为 Skill</li>\n                                    <li>设定定价：$0.5/次咨询</li>\n                                    <li>设置衍生条款：允许衍生但需支付 20% 版税</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">用户 B (需要法律建议)</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>搜索法律类 Skill</li>\n                                    <li>租用或按次付费</li>\n                                    <li>获取 AI 法律建议</li>\n                                    <li>费用自动分润给 A</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">开发者 C (构建衍生产品)</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>基于 A 的 Skill 创建\"合同审查 Agent\"</li>\n                                    <li>支付一次性衍生费 $100</li>\n                                    <li>每次使用时 A 获得 20% 版税</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <div class=\"h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-building text-5xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">企业知识库 Agent</h3>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 text-sm\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">企业 D</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>将内部培训资料创建为 Skill 资产</li>\n                                    <li>设定仅限内部使用的扩展权</li>\n                                    <li>员工通过 OpenClaw 访问</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">员工 E</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>通过企业账号访问</li>\n                                    <li>使用内部知识库 Agent</li>\n                                    <li>使用记录自动记录供审计</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 p-3 bg-green-50 rounded-lg border border-green-100\">\n                                <p class=\"text-green-800 text-sm\">\n                                    <i class=\"fa fa-info-circle mr-1\"></i>\n                                    特别适合内部知识沉淀和合规审计场景，确保知识资产的安全可控和可追溯。\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">\n                    <div class=\"h-40 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-pencil-square-o text-5xl\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3\">跨平台 AI 助手</h3>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 text-sm\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">开发者 F</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>创建 AI 写作 Skill</li>\n                                    <li>通过 ECHO 扩展权授权给多个平台</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">平台 G (Telegram Bot)</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>申请扩展权</li>\n                                    <li>获得授权后在 Telegram 提供服务</li>\n                                    <li>每次使用向 F 分润</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-900 mb-1\">用户 H</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside pl-2 space-y-1\">\n                                    <li>在 Telegram 使用 AI 写作</li>\n                                    <li>费用自动分润给 F 和平台 G</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Economic Model Section -->\n    <section id=\"economic\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">经济模型</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    公平、透明、可持续的收益分配机制\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-indigo-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-indigo-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary\">使用权收益分配</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm\">每次调用的收益分配比例</p>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">创作者/所有者</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">80%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-primary h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 80%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">协议层</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">15%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-primary h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 15%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">生态基金</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary\">5%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-primary h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 5%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-purple-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-purple-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-secondary\">衍生权收益分配</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm\">一次性衍生费 + 使用版税</p>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">一次性衍生费</p>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>亲代创作者</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">70%</span>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>亲代生态</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">20%</span>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>协议层</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">10%</span>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">衍生使用版税 (每次调用)</p>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>衍生品所有者</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">60%</span>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>亲代 (n代)</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">累计 30%</span>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                                    <span>协议层</span>\n                                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">10%</span>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-blue-200\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-blue-700\">扩展权收益分配</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm\">场景使用费分配</p>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">资产所有者</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">75%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 75%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">场景受益人</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">15%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 15%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                            <span class=\"font-medium\">协议层</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-700\">10%</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-3\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-blue-600 h-3 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 10%\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center\">定价模型</h3>\n                <div class=\"code-block\">\n<pre>type PricingModel =\n  | { type: 'TimesBased'; pricePerUse: bigint }                // 按次付费\n  | { type: 'DurationBased'; pricePerMinute: bigint; minMinutes: number }  // 按时长付费\n  | { type: 'Subscription'; pricePerMonth: bigint; features: string[] }    // 订阅制\n  | { type: 'Freemium'; freeUses: number; pricePerUseAfter: bigint }      // 免费+超出付费\n  | { type: 'Hybrid'; base: bigint; usage: bigint; maxMonthly: bigint }   // 混合模式</pre>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Roadmap Section -->\n    <section id=\"roadmap\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">技术实现路径</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">\n                    分三阶段逐步完善平台功能\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <!-- Timeline Line -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-4 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 bg-indigo-200 transform md:-translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Stage 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-12\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start\">\n                            <div class=\"flex md:w-1/2 md:justify-end md:pr-8 mb-4 md:mb-0 md:text-right\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 text-green-800 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-3\">\n                                        <i class=\"fa fa-check\"></i> 第一阶段：基础框架 ✅\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">已完成</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 md:justify-end\">\n                                            <span>EchoAgentFactory 合约设计</span>\n                                            <i class=\"fa fa-check text-green-500\"></i>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 md:justify-end\">\n                                            <span>EchoAgentRegistry 合约设计</span>\n                                            <i class=\"fa fa-check text-green-500\"></i>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 md:justify-end\">\n                                            <span>ECHO Protocol TypeScript SDK</span>\n                                            <i class=\"fa fa-check text-green-500\"></i>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 md:justify-end\">\n                                            <span>简单的能力注册和执行</span>\n                                            <i class=\"fa fa-check text-green-500\"></i>\n                                        </li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-500 border-4 border-white shadow transform md:-translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-check\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 md:pl-8\">\n                                <!-- Empty for right side -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Stage 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 mb-12\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start\">\n                            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 md:justify-end md:pr-8 mb-4 md:mb-0 hidden md:block\">\n                                <!-- Empty for left side -->\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-500 border-4 border-white shadow transform md:-translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-check\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 md:pl-8\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-green-100 text-green-800 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-3\">\n                                        <i class=\"fa fa