{"type":"message","id":"4d62dc47","parentId":"d02ee9ea","timestamp":"2026-04-07T09:02:33.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_l25ao8fsa9vh4q59gwf68gp6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echonexus/src/main.tsx","content":"import React from 'react'\nimport ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client'\nimport App from './App.tsx'\nimport './index.css'\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <App />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775552537769,"responseId":"02177555253820876a6743aa0fde56972f5060a904fa2187ac2e5"}}
{"type":"message","id":"720c0290","parentId":"4d62dc47","timestamp":"2026-04-07T09:02:33.447Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_l25ao8fsa9vh4q59gwf68gp6","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 236 bytes to /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echonexus/src/main.tsx"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775552553440}}
{"type":"message","id":"aac42236","parentId":"720c0290","timestamp":"2026-04-07T09:03:00.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ymagyjiuj8i4u3xdqyxu8mt0","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/echonexus/README.md","content":"# EchoNexus - AI Agent 能力资产化协议\n\n基于 ECHO 区块链协议和 OpenClaw AI Agent 生态的结合，实现\"能力即资产，调用即分润\"。\n\n## 核心概念\n\n**ECHO 四权 → AI 能力映射：\n\n| ECHO 协议 | EchoNexus AI |\n|-----------|--------------|\n| 所有权 (Ownership) | Agent/Skill 创作者的完整控制权 |\n| 使用权 (Usage) | 按次/按时长付费调用 Agent 能力 |\n| 衍生权 (Derivative) | 基于已有 Skill 构建组合 Skill |\n| 扩展权 (Extension) | 跨平台/场景授权使用能力 |\n\n## 架构设计\n\n四层架构：\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                       用户交互层 (Frontend)                      │\n│  - DApp 市场界面  - 创作者工作台  - 消费者控制台  - 开发者面板   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                    EchoNexus Hub 调度层                          │\n│  能力路由  权限裁决  计费结算  能力注册  语义索引  使用追踪   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n         ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n         ▼                    ▼                    ▼\n┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐\n│   ECHO 合约层    │  │   索引层(IPFS)  │  │ OpenClaw 执行层 │\n│  - 资产存证      │  │  - 元数据索引   │  │  - Agent 运行   │\n│  - 权限管理      │  │  - 语义向量    │  │  - Skill 调用   │\n│  - 自动分润      │  │  - 能力发现    │  │  - 结果返回     │\n│  - 事件日志      │  │  - 推荐引擎    │  │  - 沙箱隔离     │\n└──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘\n```\n\n## 技术栈\n\n- **框架：React 18 + TypeScript + Vite\n- **UI：** Tailwind CSS\n- **Web3：** ethers.js v6 + wagmi v2\n- **状态管理：** Zustand\n- **图表：** Recharts\n\n## 开发\n\n```bash\ncd echonexus\npnpm install\npnpm dev\n```\n\n## 经济模型\n\n### 使用权收益分配（优化版）\n\n- 创作者/所有者: **75%**\n- OpenClaw 执行节点: **8%**\n- 协议层: **12%**\n- 生态基金: **5%**\n\n### 衍生权收益分配\n\n- 一次性衍生费：亲代 70% / 生态 20% / 协议 10%\n- 使用版税：衍生品所有者 60% / 亲代累计 30% / 协议 10%\n\n### 扩展权收益分配\n\n- 资产所有者: 75%\n- 场景受益人: 15%\n- 协议: 10%\n\n## 许可证\n\nMIT\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775552553449,"responseId":"02177555255388676a6743aa0fde56972f5060a904fa218ed0b71"}}
