is available)\n+ postcss 8.5.8\n+ tailwindcss 3.4.19 (4.2.2 is available)\n+ typescript 5.9.3 (6.0.2 is available)\n+ vite 5.4.21 (8.0.5 is available)\n\n╭ Warning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n│                                                                              │\n│   Ignored build scripts: bufferutil@4.1.0, esbuild@0.21.5, keccak@3.0.4,     │\n│   utf-8-validate@5.0.10.                                                     │\n│   Run \"pnpm approve-builds\" to pick which dependencies should be allowed     │\n│   to run scripts.                                                            │\n│                                                                              │\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\nDone in 33.4s using pnpm v10.32.1\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"quiet-slug","exitCode":0,"aggregated":"Progress: resolved 1, reused 0, downloaded 0, added 0\n WARN  deprecated eslint@8.57.1: This version is no longer supported. Please see https://eslint.org/version-support for other options.\n\n   ╭───────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n   │                                               │\n   │     Update available! 10.32.1 → 10.33.0.      │\n   │     Changelog: https://pnpm.io/v/10.33.0      │\n   │   To update, run: corepack use pnpm@10.33.0   │\n   │                                               │\n   ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\nProgress: resolved 15, reused 0, downloaded 9, added 0\nProgress: resolved 21, reused 0, downloaded 13, added 0\nProgress: resolved 24, reused 0, downloaded 15, added 0\nProgress: resolved 35, reused 0, downloaded 24, added 0\nProgress: resolved 49, reused 0, downloaded 39, added 0\nProgress: resolved 110, reused 0, downloaded 93, added 0\nProgress: resolved 144, reused 0, downloaded 108, added 0\nProgress: resolved 201, reused 0, downloaded 135, added 0\nPro